  attachedPhoto: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 14a1463ef81f6884ab8034e66163ec22, type: 3}
  logText: The writing system seems to focus on characters made from several detailed
    strokes in a vertical line, slightly resembling our own languages with Asian
    origins.\nThe red drawing on the right almost feels like a warning or notice
    of some kind, and probably isn't an actual word but a symbol instead.\n\nThe
    most interesting thing in this mural is the squid-like drawings. I wonder if
    this could have been information about something like an underground aquarium?
